```
$ gen-circleci-orb config --help
Manage the gen-circleci-orb.toml configuration file.

Read, or make a small targeted edit to, the saved config without hand-editing TOML: suppress/unsuppress a subcommand's generated job, append a composed job group, or set a parameter default override. Each edit is a single command, safe to script.

Usage: gen-circleci-orb config [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  show           Print the current configuration
  suppress       Suppress job generation for a subcommand (generate_job = false)
  unsuppress     Re-enable job generation for a previously suppressed subcommand
  add-job-group  Append a composed job group
  set-default    Set or update a parameter default override for a subcommand
  help           Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config <CONFIG>
          Path to gen-circleci-orb.toml (default: ./gen-circleci-orb.toml)
          
          [default: gen-circleci-orb.toml]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

```
